<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Arabic for Esharq Mobile. Android picks this automatically on an Arabic device and falls back
    to values/ for anything not translated here, so a missing line degrades to English rather than
    to a crash.

    Product names stay in Latin script on purpose: Discord, Shizuku, Android and Esharq's own
    English name are what users search for and what error messages elsewhere will say.
-->
